// **Takes stairs like they are level ground.**
//
// Scales the per-floor cost only. The tax on carrying freight up stairs is what a shaft answers (§6.24), and no trait should undercut that.
//
// Family argument and the full table: `SYSTEMS.md` §6.25.
#![enable(implicit_some)]
TraitDef(
    id: "trait.sure_footed",
    name: "Sure-footed",
    blurb: "takes stairs like they are level ground",
    weight: 100,
    climb_pct: 80,
)
